              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি কাশিতে ভুগলেন, tini kāshite bhuglen."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The illness takes -এ or -তে: জ্বরে ভোগা (bhogā), to suffer from fever."
            }
          ]
        },
