            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অসুখের পরে দাদু এক মাস শয্যাশায়ী ছিলেন। ôsukher pôre dādu ek mās shôjyāshāyī chhilen. After his illness my grandfather was confined to bed for a month."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Another sign of being unwell: মাথা ঘোরা, to feel dizzy (the head goes round): আমার মাথা ঘুরছে."
            }
